#   The launch sweep of leftover .part files (SweepLeftoverParts, GameAppMain.cs) does not know gameapp.built.tsv.part: a kill during that write leaves a small .part that the next write overwrites.
#
# NEW STRINGS (log only, no UI text): the `library: ...` lines above, `library: <name> was deleted from Documents after its build and no placeholder could be made (<why>): it is not in the library`,
#   `library: the built record of <name> could not follow <other> (...)`, `library: <game> could not be recorded as built (...)`, `library: the built games could not be checked (...)`. No accessibility id.
#
# MEASURED (host harness, .NET 11, Apple silicon Mac, APFS): the record (round trip, garbage lines, a name twice in any case, tabs and newlines in a field, prod.keys / .txt / a path never recorded, Seed leaves an
